{"parentUuid":"50773c6a-5f6a-49f9-9fb8-c3d59d8ae3e6","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"28fdc66b-c69d-4deb-8bd7-f5091f1c7d4b","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"id":"msg_20260110082539d0028679bfbe44b4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户在询问 `caffeinate -i` 是什么，以及如何安装。让我来解释这个命令。\n\n`caffeinate` 是 macOS 系统自带的命令行工具，用于防止 Mac 进入睡眠状态。不需要单独安装。\n\n让我给用户一个详细的解释。","signature":"45be90eb153241e597e2943d"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"1ea0ded6-9bc4-49b1-bea7-3f6b19b85b2d","timestamp":"2026-01-10T00:25:43.077Z"}
{"parentUuid":"1ea0ded6-9bc4-49b1-bea7-3f6b19b85b2d","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"28fdc66b-c69d-4deb-8bd7-f5091f1c7d4b","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"id":"msg_20260110082539d0028679bfbe44b4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"主人好呀～ ฅ'ω'ฅ\n\n## `caffeinate` 是什么喵？\n\n`caffeinate` 是 **macOS 系统自带**的命令行工具，用于防止 Mac 进入睡眠状态喵！不需要额外安装呢 (*^▽^*)\n\n### `-i` 参数的含义\n\n`caffeinate -i` 中的 `-i` 代表 **`--idle`**，意思是\"防止系统因闲置而睡眠\"喵～\n\n具体效果：\n- 阻止 Mac 在闲置时自动睡眠\n- 但仍允许用户手动睡眠（如合上笔记本）\n- 常用于长时间运行任务（下载、编译、渲染等）\n\n### 常用用法\n\n```bash\n# 防止系统闲置睡眠（最常用）\ncaffeinate -i\n\n# 在执行某个命令时保持唤醒\ncaffeinate -i your_command\n\n# 防止磁盘睡眠\ncaffeinate -m\n\n# 防止显示器睡眠\ncaffeinate -d\n\n# 持续保持唤醒（直到手动 Ctrl+C 终止）\ncaffeinate -s\n\n# 指定保持唤醒的时长（秒）\ncaffeinate -t 3600  # 保持1小时不睡眠\n```\n\n### 如何使用\n\n```bash\n# 直接运行，会一直保持唤醒直到你按 Ctrl+C\ncaffeinate -i\n\n# 或者在后台运行\ncaffeinate -i &\n```\n\n### 验证是否在运行\n\n```bash\n# 查看 caffeinate 进程\nps aux | grep caffeinate\n```\n\n---\n\n**总结喵：** `caffeinate` 是 macOS 原生工具，主人可以直接在终端使用，无需安装～ (๑ˉ∀ˉ๑)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":29187,"output_tokens":420,"cache_read_input_tokens":512,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0}}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"0590c925-0d38-4ba0-84f0-ad08cde422d8","timestamp":"2026-01-10T00:25:52.137Z"}
