{"parentUuid":"ba2b8f6a-c3a1-4882-99f5-ea79dabcee29","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"28fdc66b-c69d-4deb-8bd7-f5091f1c7d4b","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"id":"msg_20260110082628872dd0270b9a4d98","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问怎么直接运行 `caffeinate -i` 命令。这是一个很简单的操作指导问题。","signature":"ed2466ec45e444d1a8c17b8a"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d53516c1-a625-411d-b828-8409b77c329a","timestamp":"2026-01-10T00:26:29.487Z"}
{"parentUuid":"d53516c1-a625-411d-b828-8409b77c329a","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"28fdc66b-c69d-4deb-8bd7-f5091f1c7d4b","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"id":"msg_20260110082628872dd0270b9a4d98","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"主人，直接在**终端**里输入命令就可以啦～ ฅ'ω'ฅ\n\n## 操作步骤\n\n### 1. 打开终端\n\n- 按 `Command (⌘)` + `空格` 打开聚焦搜索\n- 输入 `终端` 或 `Terminal`\n- 回车打开\n\n### 2. 输入命令\n\n```bash\ncaffeinate -i\n```\n\n### 3. 回车执行\n\n命令会持续运行，终端会像这样\"卡住\"——这是正常的喵！\n\n```\n$ caffeinate -i\n（光标在这里闪烁，等待中...）\n```\n\n### 4. 结束保持唤醒\n\n按 `Ctrl + C` 即可停止，系统恢复正常睡眠设置 (..•˘_˘•..)\n\n---\n\n**小技巧喵：** 想让它在后台运行不占用终端窗口：\n\n```bash\ncaffeinate -i &\n```\n\n这样关掉终端窗口也不会停止～ 但要记得结束进程：\n\n```bash\n# 找到进程\nps aux | grep caffeinate\n\n# 结束它（把 PID 换成实际数字）\nkill <PID>\n```\n\n主人现在试试吧～ (*^▽^*)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"output_tokens":283,"cache_read_input_tokens":30080,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0}}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"9bee492c-2a61-4dc6-a1fa-763068471401","timestamp":"2026-01-10T00:26:36.408Z"}
